exports[`the host slice's markup is unchanged > the maintenance page, writable and read-only 1`] = `"<div class="MuiContainer-root MuiContainer-maxWidthLg css-5c1adp-MuiContainer-root"><div class="MuiBox-root css-8f57v9"><h1 class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h4 MuiTypography-gutterBottom css-1it4a80-MuiTypography-root">Maintenance</h1><p class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 css-1xz17g7-MuiTypography-root">Take the application out of service for planned work, with a message for anyone who tries to use it.</p><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation0 MuiAlert-root MuiAlert-colorWarning MuiAlert-standard css-7jm800-MuiPaper-root-MuiAlert-root" role="alert" style="--Paper-shadow: none;"><div class="MuiAlert-icon css-vab54s-MuiAlert-icon"><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeInherit css-1ckov0h-MuiSvgIcon-root" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" data-testid="ReportProblemOutlinedIcon"><path d="M12 5.99L19.53 19H4.47L12 5.99M12 2L1 21h22L12 2zm1 14h-2v2h2v-2zm0-6h-2v4h2v-4z"></path></svg></div><div class="MuiAlert-message css-zioonp-MuiAlert-message"><div class="MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 MuiTypography-gutterBottom MuiAlertTitle-root css-5ick94-MuiTypography-root-MuiAlertTitle-root">Maintenance mode is ON — the application is out of service</div><div class="MuiStack-root css-j3ygch-MuiStack-root"><span>Decided by: <strong>Saved setting</strong></span><span>Administrators keep access; everyone else is turned away.</span><span>Opened <date></span></div></div></div><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 css-mo54xu-MuiPaper-root" style="--Paper-shadow: 0px 2px 1px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),0px 1px 1px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.14),0px 1px 3px 0px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"><form class="MuiBox-root css-0" novalidate=""><label class="MuiFormControlLabel-root MuiFormControlLabel-labelPlacementEnd css-19opgx6-MuiFormControlLabel-root"><span class="MuiSwitch-root